#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "finger"
msgstr "finger"

#. Tag: author
#: index.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Lauri.Watts;&Lauri.Watts.mail;"
msgstr "&Lauri.Watts;&Lauri.Watts.mail;"

#. Tag: trans_comment
#: index.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROLES_OF_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "ULOGE_PREVODIOCA"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "Finger is a program to display information about users."
msgstr "Finger je program koji prikayuje informacije o korisnicima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If finger is enabled on the remote machine, you may be given information on "
"the user's real name, if they are currently logged in, if they have mail and "
"the text of their <filename>.plan</filename> file in their home folder."
msgstr ""
"Ako je finger omogućena na udaljenom računalu, dobit  ćete informacije o "
"pravom korisničkom imenu, ako su trenutno logovani, ako imaju mail i tekst o "
"<filename>.plan</filename> datoteci u njihovom prvom folderu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finger is normally associated with a user@hostname address, which may or may "
"not be the same as a users email address."
msgstr ""
"Finger je obično povezan sa  korisnik@imedomaćina adresom, koja može a i ne "
"mora biti ista kao adrese korisnika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most Internet Service Providers no longer allow finger access, so, you may "
"find that you get no useful answer for most people."
msgstr ""
"Većina Internet servisnih provajdera vise ne dozovljavaju pristup fingeru, "
"pa , možete vidjeti da ne dobijete koristan odgovor za većinu ljudi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Other people use their local <filename>.plan</filename> file to hold such "
"information as <acronym>PGP</acronym> keys, the fact they are on vacation, "
"and all sorts of information."
msgstr ""
"Drugi ljudi koriste lokalnu <filename>.plan</filename> datoteku da drže "
"informacije kao <acronym>PGP</acronym> ključeve, činjenica da su na odmoru, "
"i slične vrste informacija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the finger kioslave like this: <userinput>finger://"
"<replaceable>username</replaceable>@<replaceable>hostname</replaceable></"
"userinput>"
msgstr ""
"Koristite finger kioslave ovako: <userinput>finger://<replaceable>username</"
"replaceable>@<replaceable>hostname</replaceable></userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "See the manual: <ulink url=\"man:/finger\">finger</ulink>."
msgstr "Pogledajte priručnik : <ulink url=\"man:/finger\">finger</ulink>."
